(Now let's outline steps for each candidate type.)
(Shift candidate (alpha and beta):)
(1. create_candidate ?c)
(2. allocate_vehicle_unit ?c ?v (choose a vehicle))
(3. attach_task_profile ?c route_task_profile_alpha)
(4. confirm_candidate_preparedness ?c route_task_profile_alpha)
(5. assign_operator_resource ?c driver_operator_alpha)
(6. assign_compliance_certificate ?c compliance_certificate_alpha)
(7. apply_operational_constraint ?c ?opc route_task_profile_alpha (where ?opc is operational_constraint_alpha for alpha, beta for beta))
(8. confirm_operator_alignment ?c driver_operator_alpha)
(9. verify_compliance_certificate ?c compliance_certificate_alpha)
(10. finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation ?c)
(11. allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate ?c dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(12. execute_schedule_dispatch ?c ?v dispatch_slot_alpha)
(13. detach_task_profile ?c route_task_profile_alpha)
(14. release_operator_resource ?c driver_operator_alpha)
(15. release_compliance_certificate ?c compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Note: after execute_schedule_dispatch, vehicle becomes available, dispatch slot becomes available. So we can reuse.)
(Now we need to ensure preconditions hold at each step.)
(Let's test for shift_candidate_alpha.)
(Initial: candidate_not_created, vehicle_available, route_task_profile_available, operator_available, cargo_available, etc.)
(Step1: create_candidate shift_candidate_alpha -> candidate_created.)
(Step2: allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha (choose alpha). Preconditions: candidate_created, not vehicle_allocated, vehicle_available. OK. Effect: vehicle_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, vehicle_available false.)
(Step3: attach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha. Preconditions: candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, route_task_profile_available. OK. Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked, route_task_profile_available false.)
(Step4: confirm_candidate_preparedness shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha. Preconditions: candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, candidate_task_profile_linked, not candidate_prepared. OK. Effect: candidate_prepared.)
(Step5: assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha. Preconditions: candidate_prepared, operator_available. OK. Effect: candidate_operator_linked, operator_available false.)
(Step6: assign_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha. Preconditions: candidate_prepared, compliance_certificate_available. OK. Effect: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, compliance_certificate_available false.)
(Step7: apply_operational_constraint shift_candidate_alpha operational_constraint_alpha route_task_profile_alpha. Preconditions: candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, operational_constraint_available, candidate_operational_constraint_linked, not constraint_applied. We have candidate_operational_constraint_linked already true from init. operational_constraint_available true initially. Not constraint_applied yet. OK. Effect: constraint_applied, operational_constraint_available false.)
(Step8: confirm_operator_alignment shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha. Preconditions: constraint_applied, candidate_operator_linked, not operator_alignment_confirmed. OK. Effect: operator_alignment_confirmed.)
(Step9: verify_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha. Preconditions: operator_alignment_confirmed, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, not compliance_validation_complete. OK. Effect: compliance_validation_complete.)
(Step10: finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation shift_candidate_alpha. Preconditions: compliance_validation_complete, not candidate_finalized. OK. Effect: candidate_finalized, dispatch_ready.)
(Step11: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha. Preconditions: dispatch_ready, candidate_task_profile_linked, dispatch_slot_available, not dispatch_allocated. We have dispatch_slot_available true initially. candidate_task_profile_linked true. OK. Effect: dispatch_allocated, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked, dispatch_slot_available false.)
(Step12: execute_schedule_dispatch shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha. Preconditions: dispatch_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked, not dispatched. We have candidate_vehicle_linked from step2 (vehicle_unit_alpha). candidate_dispatch_slot_linked from step11. OK. Effect: dispatched, vehicle_available true, dispatch_slot_available true.)
(Step13: detach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha. Preconditions: candidate_task_profile_linked. OK. Effect: route_task_profile_available true, candidate_task_profile_linked false.)
(Step14: release_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha. Preconditions: candidate_operator_linked. OK. Effect: operator_available true, candidate_operator_linked false.)
(Step15: release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha. Preconditions: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked. OK. Effect: compliance_certificate_available true, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked false.)
(Now shift_candidate_alpha is dispatched, resources restored: vehicle available, operator available, compliance certificate available, route task profile available, dispatch slot available.)
